@startuml
title Delete KNN Lookup Sequence (/knn/{slug}/delete and /api/admin/knn/{slug}/{id})

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Admin
boundary "Delete KNN UI" as DeleteKnnUi
control "KnnController\n(FE Dashboard)" as FeController
control "AdminKnnController\n(BE API)" as BeController
control "AdminKnnLookupService" as LookupService
control "IAdminKnnLookupService" as IAdminKnnLookupService
entity "AgeRange" as AgeRangeEntity
entity "Region" as RegionEntity
entity "Occupation" as OccupationEntity
entity "EducationLevel" as EducationLevelEntity
entity "LearningPurpose" as LearningPurposeEntity
control "AdminKnnLookupRepository" as LookupRepository
control "IAdminKnnLookupRepository" as IAdminKnnLookupRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over DeleteKnnUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard UI file exists: Views/Knn/Lookup.cshtml.
FE controller exists: KnnController.
BE controller exists: AdminKnnController.
Delete uses route id only and returns bool in the response envelope.
Delete KNN means soft deleting one lookup row under a valid KNN slug.
Entities exist: AgeRange, Region, Occupation, EducationLevel and LearningPurpose.
Interfaces used in code: IAdminKnnLookupService, IAdminKnnLookupRepository.
end note

Admin -> DeleteKnnUi: Click delete lookup item
DeleteKnnUi -> FeController: POST /knn/{slug}/delete\nid, returnUrl?
FeController -> FeController: Validate slug
FeController -> BeController: VocaNovaApiClient.DeleteKnnLookupAsync\nDELETE /api/admin/knn/{slug}/{id}
BeController -> BeController: Check admin authorization
BeController -> IAdminKnnLookupService: Delete{LookupType}Async(id)
IAdminKnnLookupService -> LookupService: Delete{LookupType}Async(id)
LookupService -> IAdminKnnLookupRepository: Set lookup status deleted
IAdminKnnLookupRepository -> LookupRepository: Set lookup status deleted
LookupRepository -> DbContext: Find lookup entity
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT lookup table
MySQL --> DbContext: Lookup row or null

alt Lookup item not found
    DbContext --> LookupRepository: null
    LookupRepository --> LookupService: false
    LookupService --> BeController: NotFound result
    BeController --> FeController: HTTP 404 error
    FeController --> DeleteKnnUi: Show delete error
else Lookup item found
    DbContext -> AgeRangeEntity: Read AgeRange if slug age-ranges
    DbContext -> RegionEntity: Read Region if slug regions
    DbContext -> OccupationEntity: Read Occupation if slug occupations
    DbContext -> EducationLevelEntity: Read EducationLevel if slug education-levels
    DbContext -> LearningPurposeEntity: Read LearningPurpose if slug learning-purposes
    AgeRangeEntity --> DbContext: AgeRange?
    RegionEntity --> DbContext: Region?
    OccupationEntity --> DbContext: Occupation?
    EducationLevelEntity --> DbContext: EducationLevel?
    LearningPurposeEntity --> DbContext: LearningPurpose?
    LookupRepository -> AgeRangeEntity: Set Status = deleted if AgeRange
    LookupRepository -> RegionEntity: Set Status = deleted if Region
    LookupRepository -> OccupationEntity: Set Status = deleted if Occupation
    LookupRepository -> EducationLevelEntity: Set Status = deleted if EducationLevel
    LookupRepository -> LearningPurposeEntity: Set Status = deleted if LearningPurpose
    LookupRepository -> DbContext: Save lookup status
    DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE lookup table
    MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
    DbContext --> LookupRepository: Save result
    LookupRepository --> LookupService: true
    LookupService --> BeController: Success result
    BeController --> FeController: HTTP 200 OK\nbool
    FeController --> DeleteKnnUi: Show deleted feedback
end

@enduml
